|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_PARTKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PARTSUPP.PS_PARTKEY AND snowflake.TPCH_SF1.SUPPLIER.S_SUPPKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PARTSUPP.PS_SUPPKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |             Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART projection=[P_PARTKEY, P_MFGR], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_SIZE = Int64(15), snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_TYPE LIKE Utf8("%BRASS")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
